    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24b31a6ed2a768bc609290b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毕竟是比以前又更受到关注的她嘛。\n一旦确定要出道了，\n各家记者争相采访也是必然的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bc167b7d78786e418d2d1f05eb9be700a7219b89e13523af225f6b20a8def60",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067100.json",
