    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e31011532d4189bb848cf753",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听她这么一说让我紧张了一下。\n也重新让我意识到自己已经是\n背负众多期望的赛马娘的训练员了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db50c53e78f85c5896122c4ed93268d525c71cd1828533da9b479e9e48f66b1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
