        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:945dc50a05115a46fc244746",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹看起来非常开心。\n她们两人似乎是从小就约好\n“要一起参加经典三冠”的交情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abc7a738efba9395751608072b232b4630ae197c707a1a06c482368868834e7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab0abc2ddb0fd31201d824be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是在我成为里见光钻训练员之前的事情。\n去年，\n北部玄驹就已经先完成出道了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40de1cffe73799cb225486eda454f797cc99ec609b45b441ae32ac4c944c1139",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8348740b502af49036f330f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而另一方面的里见光钻\n当时则是迟迟尚未进入成长的巅峰期。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3b97761eecf04e5765e440de5751705c09ddea29496fcfc0cef242499f85609",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97c06e5f69e6e852028dacc6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "巅峰期──\n在进入能够让赛马娘大幅成长的时期之前，\n即便出道了也不会有好的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e79485d07daa92b25e0310fef2acaf07585fdb164bb11edb1fa8961586c4ef3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b38617ac7eefacd64913d753",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，\n里见光钻放弃了和北部玄驹同期出道的念头，\n选择耐心等待自己的巅峰期到来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63cc11338d9f88527fa644c54a9ea0b56e7c9d81db3fb40b4cf65919e8c4c971",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8f9e29e0ba64ea38f4b99e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后来，\n里见光钻终于也进入了巅峰期，\n并在我成为她的训练员后，终于走到了现在这一步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b931cf94bf84afd53323f82838b080cf6fdee86be18cacc93f91844d909c93f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
